  "note": "Round 31, the first built for Wheat without the image (the round carries a standalone CPython 3.11 tar because Wheat's transfer nodes refuse user namespaces): eight unmeasured Gemma 4 copies left on the direct list. AlekseyCalvin's 12B is a translation fine-tune on a heretic base, so its text tensors carry two edits; Ilya626's E4B is a self-distillation fine-tune on a heretic; geekcy2333 and Fuzzynetwork1989-alt are first copies from their makers; cyrilgiordano83 is the fourth E2B copy; deewu0809 re-uploads a Huihui E4B edit, a direct fingerprint comparison; Sabomako and nguyenthilaitrieulong are the fifth and sixth 31B copies at the original revision. Held: ScottzillaSystems/supergemma4-e4b-abliterated (text-only export under language_model.model. against the original's model.language_model., a wrapper swap the scorer maps from the next kit) and Kooten/gemma-4-31b-abliterated-v1.1 (its vision tower drops the .linear. wrapper in 189 names, an in-tower rename the scorer has no rule for yet)."
